{"_meta":{"openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"\u05e4\u05e8\u05d5\u05e4\u05d9\u05dc \u05d4\u05d7\u05d1\u05e8\u05d4 \u05e2\u05d5\u05d3\u05db\u05df","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"\u05de\u05e2\u05d3\u05db\u05df \u05d0\u05ea \u05e4\u05e8\u05d5\u05e4\u05d9\u05dc \u05d4\u05d7\u05d1\u05e8\u05d4","openai/widgetAccessible":false,"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["tenders:read","profile:write"],"type":"oauth2"}],"ui":{"visibility":["model"]}},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Changes the signed-in user's Tendy profile filters: the categories, regions and budget range that list_my_feed, the daily digest and the alerts filter on. The change is saved. For when the user asks to get different tenders, or describes a line of business other than the one in the profile (get_my_profile shows the current filters). Categories are slugs or Hebrew names from list_categories, a main category or a subcategory; set_categories replaces all categories, add_categories and remove_categories keep the rest. The result lists the profile before and after, what did not change and why, and how many open tenders fit before and after.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"add_categories":{"description":"Add these categories, keeping the existing ones. Slug or Hebrew name.","items":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"add_regions":{"description":"Add regions. One or more of: \u05d0\u05e8\u05e6\u05d9, \u05e6\u05e4\u05d5\u05df, \u05d7\u05d9\u05e4\u05d4, \u05de\u05e8\u05db\u05d6, \u05ea\u05dc \u05d0\u05d1\u05d9\u05d1, \u05d9\u05e8\u05d5\u05e9\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd, \u05d3\u05e8\u05d5\u05dd, \u05d9\u05d4\u05d5\u05d3\u05d4 \u05d5\u05e9\u05d5\u05de\u05e8\u05d5\u05df.","items":{"maxLength":40,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":8,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"max_budget":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":100000000000,"minimum":0,"type":"num